@base = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN
@taskId = PASTE_TASK_UUID
@projectId = PASTE_PROJECT_UUID
@assigneeId = PASTE_USER_UUID

### Login: use the SEED_PASSWORD you configured
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Protection: 1

{"email":"manager@orbit.demo","password":"YOUR_SEED_PASSWORD","remember":true}

### Current user
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Refresh: your client must retain the Set-Cookie response from login
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
X-CSRF-Protection: 1

### Available projects
GET {{base}}/projects?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Available users
GET {{base}}/users?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a task
POST {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Review dashboard draft","description":"Write review notes","projectId":"{{projectId}}","assigneeId":"{{assigneeId}}","priority":"HIGH","dueDate":"2026-10-15","estimatedHours":4}

### List tasks
GET {{base}}/tasks?page=1&limit=20&sortBy=dueDate&sortOrder=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start task: use its CURRENT version, not always 1
PATCH {{base}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"IN_PROGRESS","version":1}

### Add a comment
POST {{base}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"comment":"The first draft is ready."}

### Dashboard
GET {{base}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My notifications
GET {{base}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout with retained refresh cookie
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
X-CSRF-Protection: 1
